      {
        "repo": "danielmiessler/fabric",
        "version": "v1.4.383",
        "author": "github-actions[bot]",
        "date": "2026-01-18",
        "summary": "## Changes\n\n### PR [#1943](https://github.com/danielmiessler/Fabric/pull/1943) by [ksylvan](https://github.com/ksylvan): fix: Ollama server now respects the default context window\n\n- Fix: Ollama server now respects the default context window instead of using hardcoded 2048 tokens\n- Add parseOllamaNumCtx() function with type-safe extraction supporting 6 numeric types and platform-aware integer overflow protection\n- Extract num_ctx from client request options and add ModelContextLength field to ChatRequest struct\n- Implement DoS protection via 1,000,000 token maximum limit with sanitized error messages\n- Add comprehensive unit tests for parseOllamaNumCtx function covering edge cases including overflow and invalid types\n",
        "assets_count": 9,
        "url": "https://github.com/danielmiessler/Fabric/releases/tag/v1.4.383",
        "ai_summary": {
          "change_type": "fix",
          "key_changes": [
            "修复 Ollama 服务器现在会遵守默认的上下文窗口设置，不再使用硬编码的 2048 tokens 限制",
            "新增 parseOllamaNumCtx() 函数，支持类型安全的提取，包含 6 种数值类型支持和平台感知的整数溢出保护",
            "从客户端请求选项中提取 num_ctx 参数，并在 ChatRequest 结构体中添加 ModelContextLength 字段",
            "实现 DoS 防护机制，设置 1,000,000 tokens 的最大限制并提供清理过的错误消息",
            "为 parseOllamaNumCtx 函数添加全面的单元测试，覆盖溢出和无效类型等边界情况"
          ],
          "summary_cn": "本次版本主要修复了 Ollama 服务器的上下文窗口处理逻辑，将硬编码的 2048 tokens 限制改为遵守默认配置。新增了类型安全的 parseOllamaNumCtx() 函数，支持 6 种数值类型并具备平台感知的溢出保护，同时通过 100 万 tokens 的上限实现了 DoS 防护。该变更还包含全面的单元测试覆盖，确保边界情况的处理正确性。",
          "impact_level": 2
        }
      }
    ]
